    "type": "question",
    "label": "21",
    "prompt": "Simplify the following. $3b^0$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$3$ for $b\\ne0$; undefined at $b=0$.",
      "worked": "For $b\\ne0$, $b^0=b^{1-1}=\\dfrac bb=1$. Hence$$\\begin{align*}3b^0&=3\\times1\\\\3b^0&=3.\\end{align*}$$At $b=0$, the original expression contains the undefined power $0^0$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
